cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Portfolio of Experts (PoE)"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Avigdor
    family-names: Bouaziz
  - given-names: Zhangyue
    family-names: Yin
abstract: >-
  A routing method for Mixture-of-Experts language models that applies Modern
  Portfolio Theory to expert selection. PoE augments ReLU-based routing with a
  covariance penalty on expert returns, discouraging the router from
  co-activating experts whose contributions are redundant, so the model reaches
  comparable quality while activating fewer experts per token. Avigdor Bouaziz
  and Zhangyue Yin contributed equally.
keywords:
  - mixture-of-experts
  - expert routing
  - modern portfolio theory
  - language-models
  - sparse-models
repository-code: "https://github.com/abouaz/PoE"
license-url: "https://github.com/abouaz/PoE"
